# Hual01b "Find a passage and infiltrate the base" player-input route (item54b form).
#
# Route: entry corridor -> south ledge -> valley SW -> riverbed (generator 1) -> east guerite
# (generator 4) -> baraque yard (generator 3) -> west cliff (generator 2) -> ladder base
# (TouchTrigger0, goal 1 chain armed) -> terrain hole onto the GR_sortie deck -> crawl room ->
# tunnel -> BreakableMover13 grille punch -> shaft fall (Trigger0 -> XIIIGoalTrigger0 goal 6)
# -> EndGame -> travel to Hual02.unr.
#
# Driver notes (script.rs semantics, measured): a `goto` autopilot holds forward and re-aims
# every tick until the waypoint is within 24 UU, overriding `forward 0` and `track` aiming
# while active; `teleport` clears the pending goto but leaves the last axis value, so every
# teleport is followed by a same-tick `forward 0` (and a short settle goto where the break
# needs a precise spot). Track/fire sequences only run once the preceding goto has arrived.
#
# Every sabotage is the game's own break-by-hand chain, decoded from xiii.u/xidcine.u and
# measured with the XIII_ITEM54_DEBUG probe (local/re/item54b/): the player carries Fists on a
# direct Hual01b start (Fists, FistsAmmo, XIIILeftHand, StunningSkill, SixSenseSkill, Hook,
# LockPick). `XIIIWeapon.RealTraceFire` (0x049B..0x0522) replaces a melee (WHand 0) hit with
# `XIIIPlayerController.MyInteraction.TargetActor` when the interaction set `bCanBreak`
# (`XIIIPlayerInteraction.DrawInteractions` 0x039A: TargetActor IsA BreakableMover, not
# bNoInteractionIcon, TargDist < 160, `IsBreakableByPlayer()`); `XIIIH2HAmmo.ProcessTraceHit`
# (0x00B1) then delivers `TakeDamage(15, DTFisted)`. The compteur BreakableMovers (Health 10)
# break through `BreakableMover.TakeDamage` -> `EffectiveTakeDamage` -> `Breaking` ->
# `Breaked` (0x0015: `TriggerEvent(self.Event)`):
#   gen1 BreakAbleMover1   Event 'Dispatcher1' -> Dispatcher5 (Tag 'Dispatcher1')
#   gen2 BreakAbleMover20  Event 'Dispatcher2' -> Dispatcher4 (Tag 'Dispatcher2')
#   gen3 BreakableMover9   Event 'Dispatcher3' -> Dispatcher3 (Tag 'Dispatcher3')
#   gen4 BreakableMover7   Event 'Dispatcher4' -> Dispatcher2 (Tag 'Dispatcher4')
# each Dispatcher fires OutEvents 'BreakN' -> XIIIGoalTrigger1/2/6/7 (GoalNumber 99) ->
# `xidmaps.Hual01b.SetGoalComplete(99)`: the counter walks objectives 3/4/5 and the 4th break
# promotes goal 6 and kills the ladder's pain volume. The same 'DispatcherN' event dismisses
# the level's own comic-focus window (`CWndFocusTrigger1..4`, whose `WaitForBeingSeen.Timer`
# set `self.Tag = self.EventFinFocus` = 'DispatcherN'/'Break2' when the window opened) through
# the trigger's own `WaitEndFocus.Trigger` - no input bridge anywhere.
#
# The labelled teleports cover measured impassables only (probes under local/re/item54b/ and
# local/re/item54/):
#  - t=3.50  the entry corridor is buried by entree_new mesh + terrain south of y~-250
#            (item54 probes J/L: walk stalls at y~-35; box-probes: StaticMeshActor43 +
#            TerrainInfo0 pinch); the BreakableMover6 grille is unreachable from inside.
#  - t=50.0  the riverbed nav chain stalls against a wall at x=-2819: the walk freezes at
#            (-2819.1,-3159.8) for 20+ s pushing east (route v2 run t=50-70 and probe Q
#            t=60-72, both measured); the teleport lands on the measured gen1 sabotage spot
#            (-1183,-3450,-1015) of probe gen1_track (fire 1 targets the protective grille
#            BreakableMover11 at TargDist 53.3, fire 2 the compteur at 57.7, bCanBreak=true).
#  - t=55.0  the east chain from the riverbed stalls: the v1 run froze at (-1034.6,-3202.5)
#            for 42 s (route_debug t=72-114) and probe Q stalled at (-2435,-2537) and
#            (-419,-2810); the teleport lands on the gen4 approach (3600,-1310) that probe
#            new_spots walked down to (3600,-1121) where track+fire reaches the compteur at
#            TargDist 50.1.
#  - t=147.0 the baraque pocket's east side is sealed: the yard walk slides on the
#            StaticMeshActor1 slope and presses StaticMeshActor46 at (441,2756) (route v6
#            t=147-156 and the v1 run t=188-196, both measured); the teleport lands on probe
#            gen3_gen2b's pocket start (-150,2700), from which the measured walk reaches the
#            gen3 sabotage spot (fire 1 the protective grille BreakableMover63 at TargDist
#            41.8, fire 2 the compteur at 42.5).
#  - t=158.5 the x~-2800 mountain spur (item54 probe X: TerrainInfo2 blocks the
#            (-2741,3194)->(-3139,2815) traverse) seals the west path; the teleport lands
#            on the measured gen2 sabotage spot (-4852,2300,-880): every walked approach
#            stalls 32 UU short of a working spot against the niche wall (probes gen2c/gen2d:
#            the walk stops at (-4819.7,2300) and no aim reaches the compteur from there),
#            while the yaw-0 ray from the teleported spot clips the compteur (measured
#            TargetActor=BreakAbleMover20 TargDist=121.1 bCanBreak=true, route v2 run t=211.5).
#  - t=156.0 the east return past the same spur is terrain-blocked in the reverse direction
#            (item54 probe X); lands at the ladder approach (TouchTrigger0 r300 zone).
#  - t=185.0 the GR_sortie deck -> crawl-room transition is sealed: BreakableMover57 sits
#            under the solid deck, the south ledge wall blocks, the niche is a dead-end
#            pocket (item54 probes F/G/H/I); the teleport lands inside the crawl room on the
#            measured floor (-1360).
# The gens 1/4/3 break positions are the ends of walked legs (no teleports there): gen3 is
# reached on the yard walk to (-110,2790) (probe gen3_gen2b: fire 1 targets the protective
# grille BreakAbleMover63 at TargDist 41.8, fire 2 the compteur at 42.5). Break order
# 1,4,3,2 exercises the SetGoalComplete(99) counter to 4; goal 6 becomes primary after the
# 4th break, so the shaft Trigger0 completes it and EndGame requests the Hual02.unr travel.
# The crawl grille punch is measured (probe crawl8): crouched at (4480,-3120), level aim,
# one fist fire breaks BreakableMover13 (Health 10 -> -5, PlaySound Grille_break_dry).
t=0.50 goto -5428 -500
t=3.50 teleport -5428 -720 -990
t=3.50 forward 0
t=4.50 goto -5428 -1400
t=10.00 goto -5428 -2200
t=16.00 goto -5333 -2435
t=22.00 goto -4400 -2950
t=28.00 goto -3596 -3095
t=33.50 goto -3000 -3060
t=38.50 goto -2758 -2920
t=44.00 goto -2652 -2974
# generator 1 (riverbed, east bank chain): the riverbed wall is the measured stall; break by
